st to level something up or press your luck at collecting enough rare thingies for a chance to find yet other rare thingies to indirectly help you get better at doing even more missions over and over.\nIncredibly grindy.\n\n(Still, I don't *really* have anything against people playing and supporting this game, so here's a couple tips:\nThe first mission you do each day will give double Credits currency. Higher level Infested Defense and The Index are good choices for this daily \"money run.\" And prioritize Platinum currency towards warframe and weapon slots. Maybe a color palette if you highly value aesthetics and have the spare $.)", "timestamp_created": 1555361494, "timestamp_updated": 1559261129, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.5", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "50150149", "author": {"steamid": "76561198278049054", "personaname": "g-eras18", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198278049054/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 49, "playtime_forever": 13711, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 7668, "last_played": 1688763353, "avatar": "8a4d302f9814c2a7b7bf652b1b1644816f9287b4"}, "language": "english", "review": "played it for a while didn't like it\nspace mom left me :^(\nEdit: 127 huers in", "timestamp_created": 1555357562, "timestamp_updated": 1555359222, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 3, "weighted_vote_score": "0.44397464394569397", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "50149532", "author": {"steamid": "76561198139594359", "personaname": "